Fredrik Nyman wrote:
> 
> By the way, how do the 21164a and the 21164PC differ?
> 

The 21164a is the full-blown 21164 EV5 architecture implemented in CMOS6
process technology.

The 21164PC (or PCA56) is a new design of the EV5 architecture
implemented in CMOS6 process. 21164PC incorporates the Alpha Motion
Video Instructions (MVI), DEC's answer to VIS and MMX.

