I know this does not help many people out there, but for the past 8
months
I have been using a USAMobile Alpha pager, via email.  They have been
offering email paging as a free service.  The nice part is that any of
my VMS
software just issues a single line DCL mail message.  It is pain getting
messages at 2:00am from a program errors or machine connection errors in
our teleradiology system, but I can logon fix it before any physicians 
notice a problem.

