If PowerMac or MAE sales have any relation to this.. well they probably
have a better relationship than VAX->Alpha, since 68xxxMacOS was ported
more or less whole to the RS6000... in terms of hardware sales the impact
is small. Small. Small small small. I say that as a Mac freak; and I say
it as someone with a long enough acquaintance with the vagaries of program
execution to blithely suggest development of higher level interpreters
without a second thought. They're not buying PowerMacs for the
