|>Well, as Fortran's go Digital have a much better name than Microsoft,
|>which is good news.  But where is the _visual_ part to all this ?  Will
|>the new product produce real Windows programs without having to write C
|>or Visual Basic code ?  The announcement says nothing much about this,
