You're right - this is an important point that we omitted in the announcement
material - but your fears are unfounded.

DIGITAL Visual Fortran includes all of the application and library types 
of Fortran PowerStation, including the QuickWin library that makes Windows
applications easy to create.  The kit contains numerous examples, you'll find
one of them, Calendar, on our web site.  We also provide the necessary
