   2.0   18.95  891.83                      monte_carlo

The rest is below 2% (fast_routines.c was not used).  Now the same for
the "fast RISC" routines:

 %Time Seconds Cumsecs  #Calls   msec/call  Name
  16.2  138.55  138.55  513056      0.2700  matrix_matrix_multiply
  13.5  114.85  253.40  237792      0.4830  calc_UV_sub_UdagV_add
