is 800-669-4727; Fax 800-652-4532.  Technical support number they gave was
800-697-4727 (almost, but not quite, the same number as Sales); Fax
800-480-4284.

As for me, well, a Xerox WorkCenter 250 now does the printing chores ....
no color printing, but reliable; it's ready to "go" when I'm ready ....
certainly something I could NOT say about the DEColorwriter 120ic. 



