From: "George Erhart" <gerhart@lucent.com>
Subject: My experience with an Alpha clone supplier
Date: 1997/03/13
Message-ID: <01bc2fb4$51cc6620$010d0787@echo.cb.lucent.com>#1/1
X-Deja-AN: 225189869
