For those of you who downloaded the source code, I made the changes
that Robert (thanks!) suggested, so you can ftp them again. There
were a few other points where this would make a big difference, 
especially in the shift routines in com.c.

BTW, I wrote the first version of the code in assembly
(CDPEAC) on the CM5 (the assembly routines ran at nearly 100MFlops/node,
which was quite an achievement back in those days), and then moved it
to the T3D. So I did not write it for any machine in particular.

