Hmmm, I don't think a FAQ already exists ...

In addition, the 3100 has 10 MBit ethernet (AUI and 10Base2) and two serial 
interfaces (DZ11).

: What are the power supply requirements?  220V or 120V?

The US versions should run on 110/120V, I think. The systems we have here in 
Germany run on 220V, of course :-). I don't know if the power-supply is
switchable/auto-switching, though.

: 30 or 72 pin simm banks ( or proprietary ) ?

